    <title>Complex Analytic Structure of Hybrid Classes of Generalized Polynomial-like Mappings</title>
    <updated>2026-10-19T08:09:36Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.25983v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2610.25983v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>In this paper, we study hybrid classes of generalized polynomial-like mappings. We show that locally they are complex analytic submanifolds with finite codimension equal to the total order of critical points in the filled Julia set (counting multiplicity).</summary>
